  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Non-ODA - Component 4 rapid response facility: DCE fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funds used to fund NPPD Deployable Civilian Experts (DCE). This falls under Component 4 of the Conflict Resolution Programme and is intended to be used to fund DCEs fitting the programme&apos;s objectives, including on Women, Peace and Security (WPS).</narrative>
  </description>
